    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Construction\" title=\"Lightsaber Construction\">Lightsaber Construction</a></i> </p><p>This rare <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Modification\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber Modification\">Lightsaber Modification</a> removes the activation button from the Lightsaber's exterior. To activate the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, the wielder must make a DC 5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> (This can be done as a part of drawing the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, as with normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> activation). If this check fails, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> does not activate. Typically this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_Modification\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber Modification\">Lightsaber Modification</a> is used to ensure that untrained Force-users and those who have no sensitivity to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> cannot effectively use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>. </p>",
